  "merger_description": "L'Or\u00e9al S.A.\u00a0and its subsidiaries (**L'Or\u00e9al**), through its wholly-owned subsidiary L'Or\u00e9al India Private Limited, proposes to acquire 65.22% of the share capital of\u00a0Onesto Labs Private Limited (**Innovist**).\n\nL'Or\u00e9al conducts research, development, manufacturing, marketing, distribution and sale of beauty and personal care products. In Australia, L'Or\u00e9al sells haircare, skincare, makeup and fragrances wholesale through pharmacies, supermarkets and retailers, as well as through their own branded retail stores YSL Beauty Boutiques, Aesop and Kiehl\u2019s.\n\nL'Or\u00e9al supplies key brands in Australia such as L'Or\u00e9al, Garnier, Maybelline, Lanc\u00f4me, Yves Saint Laurent, Vichy, La Roche Posay, K\u00e9rastase, Aesop and Kiehl\u2019s.\n\nInnovist manufactures and sells beauty and personal care products. Innovist sells hair care, skincare and sun care products under the brand names Bare Anatomy, Chemist at Play, SunScoop and Vinci. In Australia, Innovist sells its Bare Anatomy and Chemist at Play products directly to consumers.",
